        {
          "book": "ISA",
          "chapter": 21,
          "verse": 1
        }
      ],
      "en": "The burden of the wilderness of the sea. As whirlwinds in the South sweep through, it comes from the wilderness, from an awesome land.",
      "ko": "해변 광야에 관한 경고라 적병이 광야에서, 두려운 땅에서 남방 회리바람 같이 몰려 왔도다",
      "source_text_hash": "492549e5a2657b77f29d9b57ad3ae9e2f78f549da99c4aaf92b1407334193bbd",
      "translation_text_hash": "9c5cb9e0b7f03b850afb6b757ee23c6d0529cee72b28ee50d28059fbdef437eb",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "해변 광야에 관한 경고라 적병이 광야에서, 두려운 땅에서 남방 회리바람 같이 몰려 왔도다"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "9c5cb9e0b7f03b850afb6b757ee23c6d0529cee72b28ee50d28059fbdef437eb"
      ]
    },
    {
      "canonical_locator": "bible:web:ISA:21:2",
      "sequence": 18038,
      "chapter_label": "ISA 21",
      "verse_label": "2",
      "locator": {
        "book": "ISA",
