      "raw_locator": [
        {
          "book": "ISA",
          "chapter": 21,
          "verse": 4
        }
      ],
      "en": "My heart flutters. Horror has frightened me. The twilight that I desired has been turned into trembling for me.",
      "ko": "내 마음이 진동하며 두려움이 나를 놀래며 희망의 서광이 변하여 내게 떨림이 되도다",
      "source_text_hash": "57ebeb4fb48594d6cca6112e97a42828b759a22e12f93efc010c00b359845988",
      "translation_text_hash": "85224d1e215e83b9b539d847470a6b0d83ecdc62648c06361628c2267284838e",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "내 마음이 진동하며 두려움이 나를 놀래며 희망의 서광이 변하여 내게 떨림이 되도다"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "85224d1e215e83b9b539d847470a6b0d83ecdc62648c06361628c2267284838e"
      ]
    },
    {
      "canonical_locator": "bible:web:ISA:21:5",
      "sequence": 18041,
      "chapter_label": "ISA 21",
